p. 1)

śrīdevyuvāca |

jñātaṃ bhavatprasādena yathākālasya vañcanam |
mantrasya sārasaṃbhūtamidānīmauṣadhaṃ vada ||

yena siddhyanti dehāni santitāni hitāya ca |
jarāroga haraṃ kalpaṃ tadvada tripurāntaka ||

santyauṣadhānyanekāni manuṣyānāṃ hitāya ca |
pūrvantu yattvayā proktaṃ pratyakṣaṃ kathayasya me ||

śrī-īśvarovāca |

tithinakṣatravāreṇa ṛtubhedaiḥ parigrahaḥ |
khananotpāṭanaṃ mantraiḥ kārayedvai cikitsakaḥ ||

auṣadhaṃ kālayogena gṛhṇāti paramaṃ balam |
śaraddhemantayordevitvaco mūlasya saṃgrahaḥ ||

śiśire ca phalaṃ samyak mūlaṃ sārasamanvitam |
vasante puṣpapatrañca grīṣme ca phalabījake ||

svakāle balavantopi varṣāsu taravaḥ sadā |
mūle śuṣke balaṃ cārddhaṃ mūlādau bheṣaje tathā ||

grīṣmavarṣikayoretat śarat saṃpūrṇado bhavet |
vṛkṣādīnāṃ phalaṃ bījaṃ svakīye ca ṛtau tathā ||

balavat paritaḥ sarvā oṣadhyaḥ parikīrtitāḥ |
jalajā sthalajā vṛkṣā latāścāpi tathaiva ca ||

p. 2)

grāmyaṇyāragulmavallī oṣadhaḥ parikīrtitāḥ |
jātirdravyaṃ guṇaṃ cihnairauṣadhaṃ vyādhisaṃkṣayam ||

phalapuṣpalatā eva svakāle balinastathā |
niśāyāṃ jalajā vīryāḥ sthalajā balino divā ||

atha rogajanma nakṣatraphalam |

kṛttikāyāṃ kadācihnai vyādhirutpadyate kvacit |
navarāt bhavet pīḍā trirātraṃ rohiṇīṣu ca ||

mṛgaśīrṣe pañcarātram ārdrā prāṇairvimucyate |
punarvasau ca puṣyāyāṃ saptarātraṃ vidhīyate ||

navarātraṃ tathāśleṣā śmaśānāntaṃ maghāsu ca |
dvaumāsau pūrvaphalgunyamuttarāsu tripañcakam ||

hastābhyāṃ saptame mokṣaḥ citrāyāmarddhamāsakam |
māsadvayaṃ bhavet svātyāṃ viśākhe viṃśatirdinam ||

maitrecāpi daśāhāni jyeṣṭhāyāmarddhamāsakam |
mūlena jāyate śeṣaṃ pūrvāṣāḍhā tripañcakam ||

ūnaviṃśottarāṣāḍhā dvaumāsau śravaṇā tathā |
dhaniṣṭhāyāmarddhamāso vāruṇe ca daśāhikam ||

pūrvabhādrapade devi ūnaviṃśati vāsarān |
tripadañcāpya hi vadhne revatyāṃ daśarātrakam ||

ahorātre cāśvinīñca bharaṇyāñca gatāyuṣam |
evaṃ krameṇa janīyānnakṣatreṇa yathoditam ||

uragaśatabhiṣārdrā svātimūlātripūrvā
śaniravikujavārāḥ krūratārā viruddhāḥ |
yadi bhavati caturthī cāṣṭamī bhūtaṣaṣṭhī |
parihara tithimetāṃ rogināṃ mṛtykālam ||

p. 3)

pañcamī candravāre ca dvitīyā ca vṛhaspatau |
śukre caiva caturthī ca rogināṃ mṛtyumādiśet |
saptāhaṃ vārayogena triguṇaṃ tithisaṃyutam ||

tithinakṣatrayormāsaṃ tribhiḥ kālena jīvati ||



atha mṛtyucihnam |

śrīdevyuvāca |

yāni cihnāni maraṇānnṛṇāṃ pūrvaṃ bhavanti hi |
tāni cihnāni katicit brūhi me jagadīśvara ||

śrī-īśvarovāca |

vadāmi kālacihnāni jāyate yāni dehinaḥ |
mṛtyau nikaṭamāpanne tatraitāni niśāmaya ||

yasya nāsāpuṭe vāyuryasya vāti divāniśam |
akhaṇḍameva tasyāyuḥ kṣaredahnā trayeṇa hi ||

dvyahorātraṃ tryahorātraṃ cāyurvahatisantatam |
sārddhaikamāsaṃ tasyevaṃ jīvitaṃ khalucocyate ||

vahirnāsāpuṭe yugme daśāhāni nirantaram |
vāyuścet saha saṃkrāntaṃ sa jīvati dinadvayam ||

nāsāvartmadvayaṃ hitvā yasya vāyurmukhāt vahet |
saceddinadvayaṃ sthitvā tato yamapuraṃ vrajet ||

sūryesaptamarāśisthe janmasaṃsthe niśākare |
pūrṇaḥ sa kālo draṣṭavyo yadi yāmye vahedraviḥ ||

akasmādvīkṣate yastu puruṣaṃ kṛṣṇa piṅgalam |
tasminneva kṣaṇe rūpaṃ sajīvedvatsaradvayam ||

yasya vīryaṃ malaṃ mūtraṃ kṣataṃ śukramanantaram |
ihaikadā bhavedvāpi abdaṃ tasyāyurucyate ||

indranīlanibhaṃ vyomni nage dhūmraṃ samīkṣate |

p. 4)

itastataḥ prasṛmaraṃ ṣaṇmāsañca sajīvati ||

arundhatīṃ dhruvañcaiva viṣṇostrīṇi padāni ca |
āsanna mṛtyurnotpaśyeccaturthaṃ vāyumaṇḍalam ||

bhādrehnivāre sūryasya puṣṭīkṛtya divādikam |
prakṛtyāsu ca paśyet vā ṣaṇmāsena samṛtyu bhāk ||

vetti nīlādivarṇasya kaṭvāmbādi rasasya ca |
akasmādanyathā bhāvaṃ ṣaṇmāsena sa mṛtyubhāk ||

ṣaṇmāsa mṛtyulokasya kaṇṭhoṣṭharasanāradāḥ |
śuṣyanti satataṃ tattadvicchāyasthānupañcamāḥ ||

retaḥ kavacanetrāntā malimānaṃ bhajanti vai |
tarhi kīnāsagaraṃ ṣaṣṭhemāsi vrajennaraḥ ||

saṃpravṛtte nidhuvane madhyāhne kṣeti yo naraḥ |
niścitaṃ pañcame māsi dharmarājā tithirbhavet ||

drutamāruntya śakaṭaṃ tīttvograṃ yasya mastakam |
dhruvaṃ prayāti tasyāyuḥ ṣaṇmāsāt parisaṃkṣayam ||

susnātasyāpi yasyāśu hṛdayaṃ pariśuṣyati |
caraṇau ca karau cāpi trimāsaṃ tasya jīvitam ||

pratibimbaṃ bhaved yasya padaṃ khaṇḍapadākṛtiḥ |
pāṃśau vā kardame vāpi pañcamāsā ca jīvati ||

deha prakampate yasya deharandhrepi niścale |
kṛtāntadūtāvadhnanti caturthe māsi taṃ naram ||

nijasya pratibimbasya niścale sūdakādiṣu |
sa bhramāṅgaṃ na paśyed yaḥ sa māsena vinasyati ||

māta?bhraṃset sthale vāpi dhanurendraṃ na paśyati |
kṛtvā candradvayaṃ vāpi divā dvau ca divākarau ||

p. 5)

divā ca tārakācakraṃ rātrau vyomni vibhāvasum |
yugapacca caturdikṣu śakrakodaṇḍamaṇḍalam ||

bhūdhare bhūdharāgre vā gandharvanagarālayam |
divāniśā ca nṛtyañca ete pañcatva hetavaḥ ||

kārāvaruddhaśravaṇaḥ saṃśṛṇoti na ca dhvanim |
sthūlaḥ kṛśaḥ kṛśaḥ sthūla stadā masānnivartate ||

yaḥ paśyodātmanaḥ chāyāṃ dakṣanāsā samāśritām |
dināni pañcajīvitvā pañcatvamupayāti saḥ ||

prakṣate bhakṣate dehaṃ piśācāsuravāyasaiḥ |
bhūtaiḥ pretaiḥ svabhigṛdhraigomāyūrmṛgaśūkaraiḥ ||

śarabhaiḥ śalabhaiśyenairaśvabhisotarai vṛkaiḥ |
svapne saṃjīvitaṃ dṛṣṭvā varṣānte yamamīkṣate ||

gaṇḍapuṣpāṃśukaiḥ śonaiḥ svatantraṃ bhūṣitaṃ naraḥ |
ya paśyet svapnasamaye'ṣṭaumāsānna jīvati ||

pāṃśurāśiñca valmīkaṃ yūpadaṇḍamathāpi vā |
yo'dhirohativai svapne soṣṭamāsāṃ praṇaśyati ||

rāsavārūḍhamātmānaṃ tailabhyaṅgañca maṇḍitam |
yaḥ paśyet svapnasamaye yamalokaṃ sa gacchati ||

svayonau svatanau vāpi yaḥ paśyet svapnagocaraḥ |
tṛṇāni śuṣkakāṣṭāni ṣaṣṭhemāsena tiṣṭhati ||

lauhadaṇḍadharaṃ kṛṣṇaṃ puruṣaṃ kṛṣṇavāsasam |
svayaṃ yo granthitaṃ paśyet sa trimāsānnlaṅghayet ||

kālīkumārīṃ yaḥ svapne vandīyāt vāhupāśakaiḥ |
sa māsena ca na vīkṣyet nagarīṃ śamanāśrayām ||

naro yo vānarārūḍho gacchet prācī diśaṃ svapan |

p. 6)

dinai samāsairvikṣeta nagarīṃ śamanātrayām ||

sa pañcābhirātrau ca sa yāti yāmikīṃ purīm |
naro yo pañcamenaiva paśyet saṃyamanīṃ purim ||

kṛpaṇopi vadānyevā vadānyaḥ kṛpaṇo'pi vā |
prakṛte vikṛrtāścaisyāttadā pañcatvamāgatā ||

daivamārgaṃ dhruvaṃ śakraṃ somacchāyā marundhatīm |
yo na paśyet dūrasthopi na jīveta vatsarātparam ||

smeraśmibimbaṃ sūryasya vahniñcaivāṃśumālinam |
dṛṣṭaikādaśa māsācca nacorddhaṃ sa ca jīvatī ||

hanyate kākapaṃktibhiḥ pāṃśuvarṣati vāmataḥ |
svacchāyāmanyathā dṛṣṭvā catupañca sajīvati ||

aśubhrāṃ vidyutaṃ dṛṣṭvā dakṣiṇāṃ diśamāśritām |
tathā śakradhanurvāpi jīvitañca trimāsakam ||

vṛte taile tathā darśe toye ca tanumātmanaḥ |
yastu paśyedaśiraskāṃ māsādūrddhvaṃ na jīvati ||

yasya vaktre śavagandho gātre vasanayorapi |
tasyārddhamāsikaṃ jñeyaṃ yoginomapi jīvanam ||

yasyā vai snātagātrasya kapolamāśuśuṣyati |
patiñcāpi jalaṃ paśyet daśāhaṃ tasya jīvanam ||

ṛkṣavānarayānastho yo gacchet dakṣiṇāṃ diśam |
svapne paśyati tasyāpi mṛtyureva na saṃśayaḥ ||

raktakṛṣṇāmbaradharā gāyanti vā hasanti ca |
dakṣiṇāśāṃ nayennāri svapne sohi na jīvati ||

nagnaṃ kṣapaṇakaṃ svapne veśamānaṃ mahābalam |
ekaṃ vā vikṣavantaṃ taṃ vidyānmṛtyurupasthitaḥ ||

p. 7)

āmastakaṃ talaṃ jastu nimagnaṃ paṅkasāgare |
svapne paśyettadāyastu sa sadyo mriyate naraḥ ||

keśāṅgāra citābhasma bhujagāṃ nirjalāṃ nadī |
dṛṣṭvā svapne daśāhe vā mṛtyurekādaśe dine ||

sūryodaye śivā yasya krośati yāti sanmukham |
viparītaṃ parītaṃ vā sadyo mṛtyuṃ sagacchati ||

yasya vai bhuktamātrasya hṛdayaṃ bādhyate kṣudhā |
jāyante dantaharṣāśca sagatāyuḥ na saṃśayaḥ ||

śakrāyudhaṃ cārddharātre candrasya grahaṇantathā |
dṛṣṭvāmanyeta saṃkṣīṇamātmajīvitamātmavit ||

nāsikā vakratāmeti karṇayornamanonnati |
netre vāspaṃ smared yasya sagacched yamamandiram ||

āraktatāmeti ca mukha jihvā ca sāmiṣaṃ sadā |
tadā prājño vijānīyāt mṛtyumāsādayātmakam ||

pidhāyakarṇī nirghoṣaṃ na śṛṇotthātmasambhavam |
naśyet cakṣuṣorjyotiryasya sopi na jīvati ||

etāni kālacihnāni sandhāni ca bahuni ca |
jñātvābhyāsaṃ naro yogamathavā kāśikāṃ vrajet ||

kālasya vañcanopāyam imaṃ satyaṃ vadāmyaham |
vinā eva mṛtyuñjayaṃ kāśīnāthasya pūjanāt ||

tathaiva rogahantyāśu vinācauṣadhi bhakṣaṇāt |



atha oṣadhotpāṭanam |

akrūrāha jayāpūrṇā riṣṭihīnā tithau tathā |
mṛdulaghu ca rukṣaśca auṣadhotpāṭane śubhaḥ ||

p. 8)

atha ṛtubhedaḥ |

athātaḥ sampravakṣyāmi bhaiṣajya ṛtubhedakam |
divārātrau tathāyujyaṃ vasantādi tathākramāt ||

vasantaścaiva pūrvāhne grīṣme madhyāhna ucyate |
varṣāyāmaparāhne vā pradoṣe paradissata ||

madhyarātrau ca hemantaḥ śiśire śeṣarātrake |
daśadaṇḍakramāddevi jānīyāt ṛtubhedakam ||

vaśīkaraṇa karmādi vasante caiva kārayet |
grīṣme vidveṣaṇaṃ kuryāt prāvṛḍvidrāvanaṃ tathā ||

śārade śāntikañcaiva hemante puṣṭikāntathā |
śiśire māraṇaṃ kuryāt ṛtukāla vibhedataḥ ||

ṛtavaḥ kathitāhyete sarva eva krameṇa tu |
vaśyādi karmasiddhiśca prayatne nāpi sarvataḥ ||

tarjanyādi samārūḍhaṃ japaṃ japyād yathā kramāt |

atha citrakalpaḥ |

raktacitraṃ palañcaiva viḍaṅga guḍakaṃ tathā |
eteṣāṃ samatā kuryāt piṣṭvāca vaṭikāścaret ||

bhṛṅgasvaja resenaiva mardayettu dinatrayam |
ekaika divase tasya ekaikāṃ bhakṣayettataḥ ||

elāni karakañcaiva kalāṃ nāgeśvarantathā |
māsaike vyādhināśañca śrīpadañca caturthake ||

tathaiva galagaṇḍañca koṣavṛddhiñca nāśayet |
balapuṣṭipradaṃ devī ṣaṇmāse kuñjaropamaḥ ||

dvimāse kāntivṛddhiśca kuṣṭhaṃ hanti trimāsake |
vṛhaspati samo vidvān saptamāse bhaviṣyati ||

mama tulyo bhavedyogī satvatsarañca bhakṣaṇāt |

p. 9)

atha maṇḍūkaparṇīkalpaḥ |

maṇḍūkaparṇīṃ puṣyārke coptāṭyaṃ ca samūlikām |
prakṣālayitvā tataḥ kuryāt sūkṣmacūrṇāni kārayet ||

ghṛtabhāṇḍe tataḥ sthāpya yāvatpuṣyārkavāsaram |
viḍālapadakaiḥ stulyaṃ kāñcikaiḥ saha yaḥ pibet ||

aplāvya saha dugdhena māsaike carvarogahā |
dvimāsa bhakṣaṇāddevi palite varjayettathā ||


atha punarnavā kalpaḥ |

puṣyārka divase saumye prātaḥ śvetapunarnavām |
samūlapatrāṃ sagṛhya sūkṣmacūrṇāṇi kārayet ||

mardayitvā tataḥ paścāt ghṛtena madhunā saha |
bhāṇḍena sthāpayed yatne yathā rakṣākarastathā ||

tato māsāntare devi campakaṃ kusumā prabham |
vasanta samaye tasya śucirbhutvā samāhitaḥ ||

nāsamekaṃ bhavet satyaṃ malamūtraṃ sagandhikam |
alipakṣmopamākeśā gauradehā bhavettadā ||

vṛhaspati sama vāgmī jīvet pañcaśatābdikam |
nāsti tulya samaṃ kalpa kathitañca punarnavām ||

sthiravāyurbhaveddehe sevanāt kalpamuttamam |


īśvara uvāca |

śṛṇu devi pravakṣyāmi nirguṇḍī kalpamuttamaḥ |
dhanadhānyakarī devi āyurārogyavarddhinī ||

śānti puṣṭikarī nityaṃ sākṣyāddevi svarūpiṇī |
nirguṇḍīti samākhyātāṃ sarvaloka sukhapradam ||

tasmādahaṃ pravakṣyāmi prayogaṃ śṛṇu sundari |

p. 10)

nirguṇḍīkalpaḥ |

nirguṇḍīmūlamuddhṛtya śobhanena dine natu ||

aṣṭādaśapalaṃ cūrṇaṃ paladvādaśa sarpiṣam |
madhu ṣoḍaśapalañcaiva miśrīkṛtya vidhānataḥ ||

ebhistu snigdhabhāṇḍe ca māsamekantu sarvataḥ |
sthāpayet dhānyarāśau ca māsādūrddhaṃ samuddharet ||

samabhyarcya guruṃ devaṃ pūjayecca vidhānataḥ |
brahmāṇīñca kumārīñca bhojayecca yathāvidhi ||

tāsāmādāya cādeśaṃ śucirbhutvā śubhe dine |
viḍhālapadamānantu bhakṣayecca vidhānataḥ ||

ahanyahani bhoktavyamidaṃ bhavati lakṣaṇam |
skandhanetrāṃ svagātrañca bhavedbalitaḥ mevaca ||

varjayedbalipalita dīrghajīvī bhaved dhruvam |
bhavati cākṣayaṃ retaḥ strīśataramituṃ kṣamaḥ ||

prakāmaṃ bhojanaṃ tasya tatastāpairnavādhyate |
āhāraṃ maithunaṃ nidrāṃ svecchayā ca karotyasau ||

vikārānmanasaḥ samyagvarddhate dṛśyate naraḥ |
prasthaṃ nirguṇḍīcūrṇasya gomūtreṇa samaṃ pibet ||

daśarātraprayogena kuṣṭhanaṣṭa pradhānakam |
nāśayecca sadā devi vāyormevamivāmbare ||

nirguṇḍī śveta taccūrṇai ajāmūtreṇa yaḥ pibet |
nakhakeśāstathādantāḥ saptāhena patanti vai ||

dvisaptāha prayogena yogasiddhi bhaved dhruvam |
trisaptāha prayogena idaṃ bhavati lakṣaṇam ||

na cāgnau dāhyate devi na jale mriyate pi ca |

p. 11)

tasya dehena lauhañca kāñcanañca na vindati ||

catuḥsaptāha yogena bhūmityaktvā nabho vrajet |
nirguṇḍī cūrṇamādāya ghṛtena saha bhakṣayet ||

kṛśastu durbalo vāpi balavīrya bhaved dhruvam |
nirguṇḍī cūrṇamādāya pibeduṣṇena vārinā ||

saptarātra prayogena kinnaraiḥ saha gīyate |
nirguṇḍī mūlamuddhṛtya gṛhe ca dhārayedbudhaḥ ||

naśyanti sarvavighnāni gṛhe nāmāśca sarvaśaḥ |



atha bhakṣaṇamantram |

praṇavañca tato māyāṃ kūrcabījaṃ phaḍāntakam |
vahnijāyānta mantreṇa śatadhā auṣadhopari ||

japtvā tu bhakṣayeddevi kalpoktañca phalaṃ bhavet |

oṃ hrīṃ huṃ phaṭ svāhā |

mantrostu |

oṃ hrīṃ huṃ phaṭ svāhā

tāvaṃ māyādvayaṃ kūrcaṃ phaḍāntaṃ vahni sundari |
aṣṭottaraśataṃ japtvā auṣadhaṃ bhakṣayet sudhīṃ ||

mantram |

oṃ hrīṃ hrīṃ hrīṃ phaṭ svāhā |

oṃ namo nāmarūpāya pādapāya kuberāya ca |
vahnijāyānta mantreṇa auṣadhaṃ bhakṣayettataḥ ||

auṣadhaṃ bhakṣayedenaṃ sapuṣṭikodanaṃ kṣaṇam |
hitvā kṣārāmlādikaṃ trirātrābhyantare tataḥ ||

auṣadhaṃ bhakṣayeddevi yathokta phalamāpnuyāt |
yāvadauṣadhaṃ bhakṣayettāvat kṣārādikaṃ tathā ||

lavaṇasnehaśākādi vātātapādikaṃ tyajet |

p. 12)

atha hastikarṇakalpaḥ |

evamanyaṃ pravakṣyāmi prayogaṃ śṛṇu sundari |
auṣadhaṃ divyarūpañca svāhā pūrvaṃ samuddhṛtam ||

hastikarṇa iti khyāto nāmnāso surapūjitaḥ |
tasya bhakṣaṇamātreṇa sarvarogāt pramucyate ||

mṛgendrañca yathā dṛṣṭvā mṛgā yānti parāṅmukham |
evamahauṣadhaṃ prāpya vyādhimātraṃ praṇaśyati ||

sutithau ca sunakṣatre sudine ca supūjite |
supuṣpai rakṣitairarghyaṃ dattvā caivottarāmukhaḥ ||

khaleta sumanasā prājñaḥ samuddhṛtya tu dhārayet |
tataḥ piṣṭvā susaṃskṛtya ślakṣṇa cūrṇāni kārayet ||

sarpirmadhusamāyuktaṃ ghṛtabhāṇḍe nidhāpayet |
ekaviṃśati rātreṇa samuddhṛtya palāṃśakam ||

brāhmaṇaṃ bhojayitvā tu svastīti vācayettataḥ |
dugdhena ca samāyuktam ahanyahani bhakṣayet ||

palaṃ bhakṣaṇamātreṇa balīpalitaḥ varjitaḥ |
śrutidharo madhuravāk śrīmāne vāmaropamaḥ ||

balavīryadharo dakṣo naro nārāyaṇopamaḥ |
dine na yojanaśataṃ gatvā ca punarāvrajet ||

jīvedvarṣaśatañcaiva nātra kāryā vicāraṇā |
prayogānyaṃ pravakṣyāmi śṛṇuṣva kamalānane ||

kṛṣṇādhenukṣīre naiva saṃloḍya bhakṣayed yadi |
pūrvokta phalamāpnoti satyaṃ satyaṃ na saṃśayaḥ ||

evaṃ māhiṣadugdhena saṃloḍya madhunā saha |
bhuktvā phalaṃ pūrvavacca labhate trayamāsake ||

p. 13)

dadhnā ca bhakṣaṇāddevi māsatrayaṃ prayatnataḥ |
pūrvavat phalamāpnoti na keśāṃ sitatāṃ vrajet ||

sarvatra jayamāpnoti vaśīkaraṇamuttamam |
jīvedvarṣaśata dve ca naro nāgabalopamaḥ ||

tathā śayanakāle ca udakena ghṛtena vā |
viḍālapadamānantu dehasiddhirbhaved dhruvam ||

yathecchayā palaśataṃ bhuktvā jarāmaro bhavet |
kalpedaṃ paramaṃ gopyaṃ tava snehāt prakāśitam ||

yasya sevanamātreṇa naro mokṣamavāpnuyāt |



atha śvetārka kalpaḥ |

athedānīṃ pravakṣyāmi śvetārkakalpamuttamam |
asya māhātmyavistāraṃ śṛṇuṣva kamalānane ||

śvetārkamūlasuddhṛtya cūrṇaṃ kṛtvā prayatnataḥ |
ādau sūryaṃ namaskṛtvā vidhivat pūjayettataḥ ||

prātarutthāya jīrṇānte gavākṣīreṇa saṃpibet |
bhavet śrutidharo dhīro valīpalita varjitaḥ ||

kāmadevasya sadṛśaḥ sarvaśāstraviśāradaḥ |
māsamātraṃ prayogena jīvedvarṣaśataṃ naraḥ ||

sarvarogavinirmukto naro nāgabalopamaḥ |
śvetārkamūlakaṃ haste baddhvā deśāntaraṃ vrajet ||

bhūtaḥ pretāḥ piśācādyā ḍākinyā guhyakāstathā |
dṛṣṭima *? tṛ palāyante śvetārkasya prasādataḥ ||

śvetā * *? rocanayā goghṛtena ca peṣayet |
lalāṭe *? lakaṃ kṛtvā trailokyaṃ vaśamānayet ||
śvetārka * *? lenaiva candanaṃ saha peṣayet |

p. 14)

etadvarāṅgake dattvā kinnarī bhavati dhruvam ||

śvetārkamūlaṃ kaṭyau baddhvā ramaṇīṃ vai ramedbudhaḥ |
dhārayet patitaṃ śukraṃ striyañca vamaśānayet ||

śvetārkaṃ padmapatrañca kaṭyau baddhvā ramet striyam |
dhārayecca naraḥ śukraḥ śatanārīṃ ramed yadi ||

śvetārkamūlamānīya svaretaṃ saha peṣayet |
tilakaṃ kārayed yastu tasya viśvaṃ vaśambhavet ||

svarasaṃ madhusaṃyuktaṃ śvetārka tulayā saha |
yāvat prajjvalate dīpaṃ tāvat śukrañca na kṣaret ||

nābhipadmadale baddhvā tanmūlaṃ dakṣiṇa kare |
dhārayecca sadā devī saubhāgyaṃ paramaṃ bhavet ||

śvetārkakalpamāhātmyaṃ tava snehāt prakāśitam |
na vaktavyaṃ kāmukāya śaṭhāya na kadācanam |



atha bhṛṅgarājakalpaḥ |

athedānī pravakṣyāmi bhṛṅgarājakalpamuttamam |
bhṛṅgarājamūlapatraṃ cūrṇayitvā tu yatnataḥ ||

kāñjikaiḥ peṣayet dhīraḥ vaṭīṃ kuryāt prayatnataḥ |
tatpibet saha yatnena sāsaike ca guṇaṃ bhavet ||

bhṛṅgarājapatrarasaṃ kṛṣṇajīra samaṃ pibet |
tailena saha saṃdadyāt valīpalitavarjitaḥ ||

bhṛṅgarājarasañcaiva guḍūkṣīrasasaṃyutaḥ |
māsamātra prayogena sarvavyādhi vinaśyati ||



atha kāchalākalpaḥ |

kāchalākalpa pravakṣyāmi śṛṇuṣva kamalānane |
kāchalāmūlaṃ kare baddhvā atīsāraṃ vinaśyati ||

p. 15)
 

atha amlālonīkalpaḥ |

athāmlālonīkalpañca kathayāmi varānane |
amlālonīrasaṃ dattvā cakṣuśūlaṃ vināśayet ||

atīsāraṃ nābhiśūlaṃ cakṣuśūlaṃ tathaiva ca |
amlālonī sācīmūlaṃ maricaṃ kuṣṭhameva ca ||

peṣayitvā pibet yastu vasantastasya nāśayet |



atha śālmalī kalpaḥ |

śṛṇu devī pravakṣyāmi śālmalīkalpamuttamaḥ |
śvetā pītā tathā raktā kṛṣṇāśceti caturvidhāḥ ||

brāhmaṇī śvetavarṇā ca pītavarṇā ca bāhujāḥ |
raktā caiva bhavedveśyāḥ kṛṣṇāśudrāḥ prakīrtitāḥ ||

caturvarṇamayī devī sarvabhūtānu prakalpinī |
śvetā pītā tathā kṛṣṇā na hi sarvatra labhyate ||

raktā na kathayiṣyāmi yā ca sarvatra labhyate |
tasyā puṣparasaṃ labdhvā vahniyogena sādhitam ||

sumuhūrte ca kartavyaṃ jñātvā candrabalābalam |
paladvayaṃ pibet prājña ekacitta samāhitaḥ ||

rajanī praharaikena unmādo jāyate dhruvam |
aṣṭo striyāḥ kāmayate svecchayā parivṛṃhitaḥ ||

ekadvitricatuḥpañcaṣaṭ saptamāṣṭamaṃ ramet |
prathame dvi pale devī catvāri ca dvitīyake ||

tṛtīye ṣaṭ palānyeva palānyaṣṭau caturthake |
pratiyāmaṃ pibet kṣīraṃ ramecca ghoṣitantathā ||

anenaiva vidhānena narasiddhimavāpnuyāt |
caturvarṣaśataṃ devi naro jīvenna saṃśayaḥ ||

p. 16)

naro nāgabalopetaḥ kāmadeva samo bhavet |
nārīṇāṃ sammato nityaṃ subhagaḥ priyadarśanaḥ ||

śīghragāmī bhāvaccaiva valīpalita varjitaḥ ||



abhayākalpaḥ |

athātaḥ saṃpravakṣyāmi abhayā kalpamuttamam |
bhakṣayet ṛtubhedena devatulyā bhavennaraḥ ||

śarate ca śitā yuktā hemante nāgareṇa ca |
śiśire pippalīyuktā vasante madhunā saha ||

grīṣme ca guḍasaṃyuktā varṣāsu lavaṇena ca |
anenaiva vidhānena bhakṣayed yo harītakī ||

tasya vṛddhirbalaṃ vīryamārogya sthirayauvanam |
agnirdahati kāṣṭhāni śarīrasya harītakī ||

kadācit kupyate mātā nodarasthā harītakī |
māteva bhakṣayed yo hi hitakārī harītakī ||

atha auṣadhabhakṣaṇe nakṣatraniyamaḥ |

athātaḥ saṃpravakṣyāmi nakṣatrauṣadhabhakṣaṇe |
ye ca ṛkṣāṇi śastāni narāṇāmauṣadhabhakṣaṇe ||

mṛgo hastā jyeṣṭhā mūlā viśākhāścānurādhikā |
dhaniṣṭhā śatabhiṣā caiva bhaiṣajya bhakṣaṇe śubhā ||

devyuvāca |

īḍā ca piṅgalā caiva suṣumnā ca tṛtīyakā |
yogīnāṃ kāryasiddhārthe nāḍītrayaṃ prasaṃśyate ||

kenopāyena deveśa prakāśyante ca nābhayaḥ ||

īśvara uvāca |

śṛṇu devi pravakṣyāmi yanmāṃ tāṃ paripṛcchasi |
bheraurvāhye sthitā īḍā śītalā candrarūpiṇī ||

p. 17)

ghṛte prakāśitā sā ca tasmāt ghṛtañca saṃpibet |
dakṣiṇe piṅgalā nāḍī divākarasamaprabhā ||

ugravīryā ca sā nāḍī madhunā sā prakāśate |
merormadhye suṣumnā ca kevalānandarūpiṇī ||

miṣṭadāḍimarasenaiva suṣumnā ca prakāśitā |
kāśmīrodbhava dāḍimā miṣṭadāḍima ucyate ||


atha jvaracikitsā |

athātaḥ saṃpravakṣyāmi cikitsā jvarasambhave |
vātikaṃ paittikañcaiva ślaiṣmikaṃ vātha dvandvaje ||

keśarājasya mūlañca chitvā tatsaptakhaṇḍakam |
ārdrakaiḥ sahabhakṣet mahājvaravināśanam ||

nāgaraṃ guḍūcīñcaiva dhanyākam raktacandanam |
uśīrañcaiva pratyekaṃ kvāthya pañcasamanvitam ||

caturbhāgaika śeṣantu tadvāristhita śeṣakam |
kampanaṃ vedānāṃ tīvraṃ jvaraṃ naśyanti vātikam ||

apāmārgajaṭā kaṭyāṃ sapta lohita tantubhiḥ |
baddhvā tūrṇaṃ ravervāre jvaraṃ hanti tṛtīyakam ||

guggulukapucchābhyāṃ dhūpite mānuṣo bhavet |
cāturthakaṃ jvaraṃ hanti kṛṣṇavastra viguṇṭhitaḥ ||

jambuphalaṃ haridrā ca sarpasyaiva tu kañcukam |
sarvajvarāṇāṃ dhūpo'yaṃ hartā rātyandhakasya ca ||

atha jvaranāśana mantrāḥ |

atha mantraprakāreṇa jvaranāśanti śṛṇuṣva me |

oṃ namo bhagavate chindi chindi amukasya śira prajjvalita paśupāśe puruṣāya 
phaṭ |

p. 18)

mantreṇānena deveśi bhūmāṅgaṃ chedanañcaret |
tato mahājvaraṃ devi vināśaṃ bhavati priye ||

devakāṣṭhaṃ guḍūcīñca dhanyākaṃ raktacandanam |
kampanaṃ vedanāṃ tīvraṃ jvaraṃ naśyantu vātikam ||

kare baddhantu nirguṇḍyā mūlaṃ jvaraharaṃ tataḥ |
haste raktapalāśasya apāmārgasya vā priye ||

mūlaṃ sarvajvaraharaṃ bhūtapretādi sambhavam |
sahadevā dhṛtā karṇe lāṅgalīmūlakaṃ gale ||

vṛhaspatimūlakaṃ vāpi mūlaṃ vāḍiyālakam |
baddhaśirasi sūtreṇa mahājvara vināśanam ||

ravivāre samutpāṭya cāpāmārgasya mūlakam |
saptasūtraiḥ kare baddhāni te jvara harantataḥ ||

samabhāgaṃ dravañcaiva ārdrakaṃ vāsakaṃ madhu |
aikāhikaṃ jvaraṃ hanti bhakṣayittvā dinatrayam ||

athānimantayeddevi śuṣkalāṅgalamṛttikā |
tilakaṃ tat prabhātena śayyāyāṃ kārayennaraḥ ||

aikāhikaṃ jvaraṃ tīvraṃ nāśayedravivāsare |

oṃ namo bhagavati chindi chindi amukasya śiraḥ prajjvala parāyaṇa puruṣāya phaṭ 
|

yadā sarasvatī tīre aputrā tāpasī mṛtā |
tasmaiva tilakaṃ dadyānmukta caikāhiko jvaraḥ ||

iti mūṣikagarte vīraṇapatre kañcīpatra
javāpuṣpaistilajalena tarpaṇam |
 

atha chedamantraḥ |

oṃ vāṇayuddhe mahāghore dvādaśārka sama prabhe |
jāto'sokṣa mahāvīryā muñcatyaikāhikojvaraḥ ||

p. 19)

vilikhedaśvapatreṇa vāhormantrañca dhārayet |
aikāhikaṃ jvaraṃ hanti puruṣo dakṣiṇe kramāt ||

samudrasyottare tīre dvivido nāma vānaraḥ |
jvaramaikāhikaṃ hanti likhite ca gṛhodare ||

devadāruka dhanyākaṃ nāgaraṃ vṛhatī dvayam |
dadyāt pācanakaṃ pūrvaṃ sānnipātajvarāpaham ||

prabhātasamaye devi muṇḍaṃ gomūtrasambhavaiḥ |
pibettadarddhabhāgena sannipātajvarāpaham ||

śephālikātvacaṃ puṣpaṃ aśvinyāṃ vaṭikākṛtā |
ajāromena badhnīyāt sannipātajvarāpahā ||


atha bahumūtracikitsā |

athātaḥ saṃpravakṣyāmi cikitsā bahumūtrakam |
sevayedauṣadhaṃ yatnāt sāmyaṃ bhavati nānyathā ||

dhātrīrasasya svarasaṃ madhunā ca pibet sadā |
bahumūtrakṣayaṃ devi kṣārañca vāsakasya vā ||



atha mūtrakṛcchracikitsā |

ajājīśṛṅgavīrantu dadhimaṇḍantu pāyayet |
lavaṇena samāyuktaṃ mūtrakṛcchra nivāraṇam ||

yavakṣāraṃ sitāyuktaṃ mūtrakṛcchra nivāraṇam |
svarṇaśephālikāmūlaṃ madhunā yat pibedbudhaḥ ||

mūtrakṛcchraṃ nihantyāśu satyaṃ satyaṃ na saṃśayaḥ |
pītasāraṃ guḍūcyāstu madhunā mehanāśanam |
sarvamehaharo dhātryārasaḥ kṣaudraniśākaraiḥ ||

atha vindukṣaya cikitsā |

ghṛtakumārikāṃ piṣṭvā kṣīreṇa yaḥ pibennaraḥ |
vindūmātraṃ kṣayaṃ devi dhātrīñca bilvapatrakam ||

p. 20)

dhātrīṃ harītakīñcaiva kṛṣṇajīrakasaṃyutam |
bhakṣayet śayane kāle vindusrāvakṣayo bhavet ||

yadā baddho bhavet vīryaṃ caraṇyau lepayettathā |
ketakīpuṣpamādāya dāḍimā vacamūlakam ||

kṛṣṇā gobhavadugdhañca bhakṣayet bhṛguvāsare |
vindusrāvakṣayaṃ kuryāt bilvamūlārkamūlake |
aśvinyāṃ vaṭikāṃ kṛtvā bhakṣaṇānnātra saṃśayaḥ ||

atha kuraṇḍacikitsā |

vāhavālyarājyañca piṣṭvā taccārdrakaiḥ saha |
kuraṇḍaṃ nāśayet bhadre lepanānnātra saṃśayaḥ ||

santaptastena maṇḍūkaṃ maṇḍūkaraktamāṃsakaiḥ |
koṣavṛddhikṣayaṃ kuryāt tailena bāhulepanāt ||

ghṛtairnīlotpalaṃ piṣṭvā lepanācā kuraṇḍahā |
athavā gṛhamaṇḍūkaśoṇitairlepanāttathā ||

kṛṣṇajīraka śuṇṭhī ca pippalī maricantathā |
eṣakoṣaraso'nena karañjamadhusaṃyutam ||


atha kuraṇḍagalagaṇḍa cikitsā |

brahmayathāstu? mūlantu piṣṭvā taṇḍulavāriṇā |
saptāhe ca harellepāt kuraṇḍagalagaṇḍayoḥ ||

atha bhagandaracikitsā |

dāḍimamūlaṃ haridrā ca ketakīṃ tasya lepanāt |
bhagandaraṃ vināśaḥ syādayaṃ yoge vidhāntaḥ ||


atha kāmalā cikitsā |

ghoṣāphalaghāta samākāmalānāśanaṃ dhruvam |
athavā nāśanasaṃkuryāt gu *?bījaṃ dvibhāgakam ||

duṣṭaśleṣma viniṣkṛtvā kāmahāmucyate karaḥ ||

p. 21)

atha vaivarṇyacikitsā |

kṛṣṇatilaiḥ sasiddhārthaistathaiva kṛṣṇajīrakāḥ |
samabhāgena piṣṭvā vai vaivarṇyaṃ mardanāddharet ||

atha kāsacikitsā |

triphalā trikaṭuñcaiva samabhāgena cūrṇitam |
madhunā saha sampānāt kaṇḍukāsaṃ vinaśyati ||

ghṛtena pacayenmūlaṃ patrañca bālakasya ca |
bhakṣeddinatrayaṃ yāvat śvāsakāsakṣayaṃ bhavet ||

pippalī devadāruñca śuṇṭhīcūrṇa samantu vai |
ūrddhvaśvāsaṃ tadā hanti pibeduṣṇajalena vai ||

atha kṣayakāsa cikitsā |

nāgakeśaramūlañca madhunā saha saṃpibet |
vāsakasya camūlaṃ vādhyañjalaiḥ kṣayarogahā ||

aśokasya ca mūlāni ajākṣīreṇa bhakṣayet |
kṣayarogakṣayaṃ kuryānmūlaṃ jīveśvarī madhu ||

gavedhukasya mūlaṃ vā bhakṣaṇe madhunā saha |
pippalīmūlakaṃ vāpi dugdhena kṣayarogahā ||

atha nāsārśa cikitsā |

dūrvādāḍimapuṣpe ca āmnātaka harītakī |
sarvasaṃpeṣayedyosau nāsāraktasrāvapahā ||

atha gudārśa cikitsā |

pippalīñca haridrāñca gomūtreṇa samanvitām |
prakṣepañca gudadvāre arśāṃsi vinivārayet ||

abhayā nayanotañca śarkarā pippalīyutam |
pānādaśoharatyāśu nātrakāryā vicāraṇā ||

p. 22)

atha karṇaśūla cikitsā |

tīvraśūlāntare karṇe saśabdakledavarddhini |
śūlonmuktaṃ kṣipet koṣṭhaṃ saindhavenāvacūrṇitam ||

arkapatraṃ gṛhītvā tu mandāgnau tāpayecchanaiḥ |
niṣpiḍya pūrayet karṇe karṇaśūlaṃ vinaśyati ||

śatāvarī taṇḍulīyaṃ madhunā karṇapūrayet |
karṇaśūlaṃ tadā hanti paraṃ yoga vadāmi te ||

śatāvarī taṇḍulīyaṃ madhunā karṇapūraṇe |
karṇaśūlaṃ nāśayanti samudidaṃ vadāmi te ||

atha cakṣuroga cikitsā |

nimbapatraṃ rasaṃ gupti sametaṃ cakṣupūraṇāt |
cakṣuśūlaṃ kṣayaṃ yānti takrabadaramūlakaiḥ ||

kākasya raktapittañca bhikṣukasya ca cakṣusī |
yatnavān sādhakaḥ śreṣṭho gṛhītvaikatra kārayet ||

śubhe dine ca sandhyāyāṃ cakṣurmadhye pradāpayet |
andhakāre'pi deveśi divyadṛṣṭi prajāpayet ||

hastiśuṇḍyā resenaiva akṣuśca pūrayedbudhaḥ |
cakṣujaṃ hanyate rogaṃ niścitaṃ śṛṇu pārvati ||

atha śiroroga cikitsā |

viḍaṅgaṃ gandhakañcaiva nīlotpalaṃ tathaiva ca |
gomūtraṃ kaṭutailañca dattvā pākaṃ samācaret ||

śivaprāṇa pānāddevi śirorogaṃ vināśayet |
dugdhaiḥ kṛṣṇatilaṃ piṣṭvā lepaṃ dadyācchiropari |
śirovyathyāṃ kṣayaṃ yāti guḍūcīmūlakena vā ||

p. 23)

atha padmagandha cikitsā |

haridrā lavaṇañcaiva maricaṃ śvetasarṣapam |
ekīkṛtvā peṣayitvā mukhe saṃdhṛtya carvayet ||

atha dantaroga cikitsā |

keśarājasya mūlañca ārdrakaiḥ saha dhārayet |
tadā na patate dantau nacet oḍasya mūlakam ||

arkapatrasya taptena dante svedañca kārayet |
tadā na patate dantau vakulatvak carvaṇāt ||

jātīpatra punarnavā tilakaṇākodanna kuṣṭhaṃ vacā |
śuṇṭhīdīpaharītakī samakṛtaṃ cūrṇaṃ mukhe dhāritam ||

vātaghnaṃ krimikaṇḍuśūlaśamanaṃ sarvamayaṃ dhvaṃsakṛddurgandhādi 
samastadoṣaśamanaṃ dantastu vajrāyate ||

athātīsāra cikitsā |

athātīsāraraktātīsārayoḥ prayogaṃ śṛṇu |
svalpaṃ prayogamātreṇa rogāt pramucyate yataḥ ||

mūlāni sahadevāyāḥ kṛtyā ca saptakhaṇḍakam |
raktasūtraiḥ kaṭyau baddhvā sarvātīsāranāśanam ||

tālamūlīñca madhunā samabhāgena yaḥ pibet |
raktātīsāra kṣayakṛnnārikela jalaṃ pibet ||

atha pariṇāmaśūla cikitsā |

hiṅgalo vakulatvacāṃ piṣṭvāca kvāthitodakaiḥ |
pariṇāmasya śūlasya kathitaṃ parivarddhanam ||

lauhacūrṇaṃ samāyuktaṃ triphalācūrṇameva ca |
madhunāsvāditaṃ devī nāmākhya śūlanāśanam ||

raktotpalamapāmārga śobhāñjana vacastathā |
lavaṇañca samaṃ bhakṣet nāmaśūlaṃ vinaśyati ||

p. 24)

mṛgaśṛṅgamagnidagdhāṃ gavyā jāmbusamanvitam |
pītaṃ kṛtpṛṣṭhaśūlānāṃ bhavennāśakaraṃ priye ||

atha vicarcikā cikitsā |

eraṇḍa mūlakaṃ patraṃ bhṛṅgarājarasantathā |
anayā kāñjikāṃ pṛṣṭvā lepā vicarcikāpahā ||

atha kuṣṭharoga cikitsā |

śvetākṛṣṇāparājitāmūlaṃ piṣṭvā lepaśca kuṣṭhatā |
athavā pāribhadrasya mūlaṃ māmaiḥ vaṭiṃ kṛtam ||

tailena pācitaṃ teṣāṃ bhakṣaṇāt kuṣṭhanāśanam |
ghṛtairuṣṇodakairvāpi sarva kuṣṭhaṃ vināśanam ||

viśvanimbadalānāñca cūrṇamāmalakaiḥ saha |
pratyahaṃ bhakṣayet yastu tasya kuṣṭhaṃ vinaśyati ||

somarājasya bījāni navanītāni melayet |
madhunāsvāditā nisyustāni kuṣṭhaharāni vai ||

kuśā harītakī dūrvā taṇḍulañcārka kṣīrakam |
kadalīrvandanaṃ śuṣka kṣāraṃ kṛtvā tu lepanam ||

śvetakuṣṭhaṃ kṣayaṃ kuryāt śāciśākasya mūlakam |
tribhāgaṃ trikaṭuṃ nimbaṃ guḍūcī ca harītakī |
bhāga eka jalaṃ piṣṭvā sarvakuṣṭhasya nāśanam ||

atha plīhāroga cikitsā |

citrakaṃ mūlakaṃ piṣṭvā kṛtvā tu vaṭikātrayam |
kadalī pakvamadhye tu bhakṣaṇāt plīhānāśanam ||

atha visphoṭaka cikitsā |

piṣṭvā kṛṣṇatilañcaiva kāñcikaiḥ pācayettataḥ |
tallepe ghraṇahā bhadre śodhañca dhārayettataḥ ||

p. 25)

samabhāgodakaiḥ pṛṣṭvā bharicaṃ raktacandanam |
dadyādārambhake pūrvaṃ visphoṭavraṇa nāśanam ||

mahānasya mūlañca piṣṭvāloḍya jalemudā |
gaṇḍaśotha kṣayaṃ yāti visphoṭañca tathaiva ca ||

atha arvudaroga cikitsā |

bhūmikuṣmāṇḍamūlañca piṣṭvāloḍya jalena tu |
pācayeduṣṭapheṇasya lepādarvada nāśanam ||

atha dagdhavraṇa cikitsā |

tilataileryavāndagdhā samaṃ kṛtvā tu milayet |
tenaiva lepanāttūrṇaṃ agnidāhaṃ sukhī bhavet ||

tilañcaivāgninā dagdhā sarva bhasma samanvitam |
agnidagdhavraṇaṃ naśyedanenaivāpa lepanāt ||

atha ślīpada (goda) cikitsā |

arkamūlaṃ samutpāṭya uttare cārkavāsare |
tanmūlaṃ raktasūtreṇa dhāraṇāt ślīpadakṣayai ||

valā cātivalā lodhra lepanāt ślīpadakṣayaḥ |
mūlaṃ daṇḍotpalaṃ vāpi haritālena lepayet ||

nirguṇḍīkeraṇḍa suvarṇa yatnehyaṣāhaminaiḥ |
śvetasarṣapaiśca piṣṭvā tu lepedbahumaṅgalā ca |
cirotthitaṃ ślīpadañca nihanti niścitaṃ sadā ||

atha nidrāmokṣopahavaḥ |

śṛṅgaṃ māhiṣa kuṣmāṇḍaṃ piṣṭvā tatsamabhāgakam |
lepayet kuci pṛṣṭhe ca yasya nidrākṣayo bhavet ||

śobhāmlanasya bījāni nīlotpalasya puṣpakam |
nāgeśvaraṃ samaṃ piṣṭvā nidrāmuñcati cāñcanāt ||

p. 26)

vṛhatīphalapakvañca piṣṭvā ca madhuyaṣṭibhiḥ |
yasya nidrāñjanaṃ dadyāt dhruvaṃ nidrā vināśayet ||

atha nidrā cikitsā |

mūlakaṃ kākajaṅghāyāṃ dhārayet śirasopari |
mantrenaivānvitaṃ yeṣāṃ bhavennidrā balīyasī ||

mantro yathā |

oṃ siddhe siddhe yoginī mahānidre svāhā |
mahānidrāyanīṃ devīṃ mantreṇānena pūjayet ||

tenaiva gṛhamadhye ca mantraṃ śata evaṃ japet |
mahānidrāyanī bhūtvā sarve svapnayitā janāḥ ||

śmaśānadaṃ kṣipeddeha kṛṣṇā gomūtra mṛttikā |
evaṃ nidrāmayī māyā saṃkṣepāt kathitaṃ mayā ||

athāvānyaṃ prakāreṇa nidrānī mantra kathyate |
yasyoccāraṇamātreṇa nidrāṃ bhavati cānyathā ||

atha adṛśyopāyaḥ |

daṇḍakākasya rudhiraṃ pittañca jambūkasya ca |
bhallūkapecakayorasthi vāmadakṣiṇayorapi ||

eṣāṃ piṣṭvā samañcaiva vaṭikāṃ kārayettataḥ |
chāyāyāṃ kārayecchuṣkāṃ mañjanaṃ tatpradāpayet ||

yāvanmātraṃ sthitaṃ netre adṛśyo bhava sundarī |
pādayostanayorevaṃ yuktimauhyaṃ manīṣibhiḥ ||

citrāgni khañjarīṭasya viṣṭhāpheṇīhayasya ca |
śobhāñjanaṃ cāsanetre nara etaiśca dhūpitaḥ ||

adṛśyaistridaśaiḥ sarveḥ kiṃ punarmanujaiḥ priye |

p. 27)

atha adṛśya nidhi darśanopāyaḥ |

kanakadhustūramūlañca tathā saptadalasya ca |
muktakeśena cotpāṭya mūlañcāvat valkalaiḥ ||

tāvanmukhe ca saṃdhṛtya sarvamudṛśyate naraiḥ |
pātālatalaparyantaṃ yatra yatra sthite nidhiḥ ||

atha nigaḍabhaṅga prayogaḥ |

tatra kālīsādhanam | ādau dhyānam |

raktavastraparidhānāṃ divyagandhānulepanāṃ trinayanāṃ hāsyavadanāṃ 
caturbhujāṃ maṇimukuṭabhūṣitāṃ śavavāhanāṃ muṇḍamālāvibhūṣitāṃ 
kartrīkharparadhāriṇīṃ māmuddhara devi kātyāyani || iti dhyātvā mantraṃ 
paṭhet |

kṛṣṇajayantīmūlañca śanimaṅgalavāsare |
samutpāṭya guvākena khāditvā svadehe svayam ||

dadyāt phutkāra deveśi mantraiṇānena sādhakaḥ |
siddhiṃ kuryāt manuṃ japtvā cāṣṭottara sahasrakam ||

kāryasiddhiṃ bhavet satyaṃ nātrakāryā vicāraṇā |

oṃ cāmuṇḍe vajrapāṇi drū-īṃ phaṭ svāhā |
anena sahasrajapena vandho mokṣo bhaved dhruvam ||

nigaḍaṃ kapāṭaṃ devi āvaśyaṃ bhañjanaṃ śubham |
chinatti jālaṃ dāsasya stambhayettailayantrakam ||

naśyet pākaṃ kulālasya gavāṃ kṣīrasya nāśanam |

atha deha durgandha haraṇam |

tilaṃ sarṣapasaṃyuktaṃ haridrā methikāntathā |
piṣṭvā tallepanāt gāḍhaṃ gātragandho vinaśyati ||

ārdrakasya ca puṣpā tumbīpatrayutāni ca |
salodhrāṇi ca tallepāt dehadurgandhamāharet ||

p. 28)

atha deha saugandhajananam |

śuṣkāmrabījaṃ harītakīṃ sondhāmāmalakasya ca |
udvartanaṃ bhakṣaṇānte dehasaugandhabarddhanam ||

kuṣṭhañca cūrṇakaṃ kṛtvā madhusarpi samanvitam |
bhakṣayet prātarutthāya padmagandhaṃ prajāyate ||

atha kāntijananam |

atasīmāṣagodhūmaṃ cūrṇaṃ kṛtvā tu pippalīm |
ghṛtena lepayet gātraṃ ebhiḥ saha vicakṣaṇaḥ ||

kandarpasadṛśo kānti bhavennityaṃ vilepanāt |
dhātrīkusumānīya phalaṃ tatra ca yo hṛtam ||

jambuphalasyāmlarase madhunā saha peṣayet |
varāṅga lepanādeva vṛddhvā kāntaiva gacchati ||

atha puṣṭijananam |

dhātakī somarāja kṣīreṇa saha peṣayet |
durbalatvaṃ bhavet sthūlo nātra kāryā vicāraṇā |

atha mukhasaugandhajananam |

yaḥ kuṣṭhacūrṇaṃ madhunā ghṛtena kakkolānvitam |
māsaikamātreṇa yāti ketakīkusumopamam ||

atha susvarajananam |

haridrā ca vacā kuṣṭhaṃ pippalī ca yamānikā |
maricaṃ saindhavaṃ śuṇṭhī eṣāṃ cūrṇastu kārayet ||

madhunā sahitaṃ cūrṇaṃ peṣayitvā śilātale |
dinañca saptabhiścaiva bhakṣitañca nirantaram |
jāyate susvaraṃ puṃsāṃ kinnaraiḥ saha gīyate ||

p. 29)

harītālaṃ kadalīdalabhasmanā |
ekayogena codvartya lomapātanaṃ bhavet ||

atha keśasya vaivarṇya haraṇam |

mustakaṃ sarṣapañcaiva uśīrañca tathaiva ca |
harītakī nakhī caiva āmalakī samantataḥ ||

sarva samaṃ parihṛtya peṣayitvā vidhānataḥ |
keśamūlaṃ samālipya mepatulyo bhaved dhruvam ||

atha stanaguṇādhānam |

srāviṇīrasakvāthyaṃ tailaṃ siddhatilodbhavam |
tattailaṃ tilakenāpi stanasyopari lepayet ||

kāṭhinyaṃ vṛddhatāṃ yāti patitāñcotthitaṃ bhavet |
vṛddho vā kanyakā vāpi jātau yasyāḥ payodharau ||

śvetoḍrasya kusumaṃ kṛṣṇadhenupayonvitam |
piṣṭvā stanayuge dadyādbhavet pīnapayodharam ||

vacāśvagandhāsaṃyuktā aśvāripatrakantathā |
gajapippalīkāyuktaṃ sadyo bhinna jalena ca ||

peṣayitvā vidhānena lepayet stanamaṇḍale |
patatentu kadācittu āmatālaphalaṃ yathā ||

rasaṃ gāmbhārīpatrasya tatsamaṃ tilatailakam |
samānaṃ jala bhāgañca dattvā pākaṃ samācaret ||

tailaśeṣaṃ parijñāya kṣaumaṃ mantreṇa śodhayet |
kucapralepanāddevi lauhavat jāyate dhruvam ||

atha saubhāgya jananam |

keśarañcaiva nimbañca paṅkajañca nirāmayam |

p. 30)

dhātakīphalapuṣpañca jambudugdhoḍhra saṃyutam ||

piṣṭvā madhuyutaṃ lepāt bandhyāpi labhate sutam |
vṛddhvā navaprasūtā vā durbhagā subhagā bhavet ||

atha lepavarāṅgayoḥ |

nimbakāṣṭhena madhunā dhūpayitvā bhagaṃ striyā |
subhagāsau bhavennārī pati dāsau bhaviṣyati ||

khañjarīṭasya māṃsasya madhunā saha peṣayet |
prātaḥkāle yonilepāt puruṣo dāsatāmiyāt ||

māhiṣa navanītañca kuṣṭhañca madhuyaṣṭikam |
bhagalepana saubhāgyāt patirdāso bhaviṣyati ||

māhiṣaṃ navanītañca miśritaṃ tatsamaṃ madhu |
badaribījasārañca piṣṭvā ekatra kārayet ||

ebhiḥ saṃmardanānte tejasvināṅganā bhavet |
gorocanā mahādevi ṛtuśoṇita bhāvitā ||

tatkṛtaṃ tilakaṃ yasya sa naro'yaṃ nirīkṣate |
tañca sarvaṃ vaśaṃ kuryānnātra kārya vicāraṇā ||

saindhavaṃ kṛṣṇalavaṇaṃ sauvīraṃ matsyapittakam |
madhusarpiḥ sitāyuktaṃ kuryāttat bhagalepanāt |
yaḥ pumān maithunaṃ gacchennānyāṃ nārī sa gacchati ||

atha strīvaśīkaraṇam |

puṣyāyāñca haret puṣpaṃ bharaṇyāntu phalaṃ tathā |

pallavañca viśākhāyāṃ hastāyāṃ patrameva ca |
mūlāyāntu tathā mūlaṃ dhustūrasya samānayet ||

piṣṭvā karpūrayogena rocanā kumkumena ca |
tilakaistrīvaśaṃ yāti yadi sākṣādarundhatīm ||

p. 31)

kokilākṣaṃ śūkaśimbī śatāvarīntathaiva ca |
gokṣuraṃ gaṇikārañca vāṭyālaka tathaiva ca ||

mahākuṣmāṇḍamūlañca ekīkṛtyañca cūrṇayet |
śuṣkapātreṇa tat cūrṇaṃ rakṣayet yatnapūrvakam ||

dugdhena sahitaṃ devi pivedrātrau samāhitaḥ |
nānāguṇaṃ bhavettasya kāminīvañcako bhavet ||

kandarpaharanārīnāṃ darpahastā bhaviṣyati |
puṣyāyāṃ vā mathāyāṃ vā hastāyāṃ vā tathaiva ca ||

śvetārkamūlamānīya kaṭyāṃ baddhvā ratiñcaret |
patiputraparityaktvā tasyārthe vrajati dhruvam ||

oṃ cāmuṇḍe jaya jaya stambhaya stambhaya mohaya mohaya sarvaṃ māṃ tvāṃ 
dama dama svāhā | imaṃ mantraṃ ekādaśavāraṃ japtvā puṣpamabhimantrya 
yasmai dīyate sā tasya vaśya bhavati |

oṃ kāmadeva hastamaparṇa uttama kuru kuru svāhā |
anena saptadhābhimantrya yaṃ pṛśati sā vaśyā bhavati ||

apabhāṣā pravakṣyāmi mantraṃ strīvaśīkaraṇam |
yasya sādhanamātreṇa śaktisādhanamuttamam ||

asya mantra yathā |

mantreṇānena deveśi trivāraṃ salilaṃ pibet |
sarvaṃ tyaktvā ca sā nārī tasya saṅgī bhaved dhruvam ||

atha dampatī prītijananam |

brahmayaṣṭi vacā kuṣṭhaṃ madhunā saha peṣayet |
aṅgalepācca vanitā nānya bhartāramicchati ||

ratikāle mahādevi śṛṇuṣva parvatātmaje |
nijaśukraṃ gṛhītvā tu vāmahaste nayet pumān ||

p. 32)

kāminīcaraṇaṃ vāmau lepanāt sa striyaḥ priyaḥ |
nīlotpalaṃ samaṃ pūgaṃ pradadyāccāparājitām ||

yasya manobhivāñchayā vaśaṃyāti varāṅganā |
hayamāraka mañjiṣṭhā mālatīkusumāni ca ||

taṇḍulāni priyaṅgulī peṣayedekayogataḥ |
anena liptāliṅga kāminī vaśakṛt bhavet ||

kapittharasa kahlāraṃ pippalī madhuyaṣṭikā |
madhunā ca samaṃ piṣṭvā lepanācca varāṅgayoḥ ||

dampatīprītimāpnoti prāṇānte nāpagacchati |
saindhavañca mahādevi pārāvatamalaṃ madhu ||

ebhistu lipta liṅgastu kāminī vaśakṛdbhavet |
dampatyoḥ prītijananaṃ nitya lepādvarāṅgayo |
kuryādvaśīkṛtaṃ yakṣa dūpaiśca tilakaṃ tathā ||

atha jagadvaśīkaraṇam |

manaḥśilā palamekaṃ sagorocanakumkumam |
ebhistu tilaka kuryāt jagadvaśya na saṃśayaḥ ||

sahadevā bhṛṅgarāja śvetāparājitā vaca |
tenaivaṃ tilakaṃ dattvā trailokyaṃ vaśamānayet ||

oṃ drū-īṃ samāseyaṃ saubhāgyaṃ gauri dehi me ||

godantaṃ haritālañca saṃyutaṃ kākajaṅghayoḥ |
cūrṇaṃ kṛtvā yacchirasi dīyate sa vaśo bhavet ||

śvetāparājitāmūlaṃ pṛṣṭvā ca rocanā saha |
yaḥ paśyettilake naiva vaśī kuryānna saṃśayaḥ ||

tilakakaraṇaṃ mantrastu ||

oṃ raktacāmuṇḍe amukaṃ mevaśamānaya svāhā |

oṃ drū-īṃ drū-auṃ drūṃ phaṭ ayaṃ mantraṃ ayuta japet |

p. 33)

gorocanā saraktena tilake ca vaśī bhavet ||

bhṛṅgarājasya mūlañca piṣṭvā śukreṇa saṃyutam |
akṣiṇīcāñcayitvā ca vaśīkuryājjagattrayam ||

atha mohanam |

bhṛṅgarājadaṇḍotpalaṃ śvetagorocanarocana |
piṣṭvā tu tilakaṃ kṛtvā mohayettu jagattrayam ||

oṃ sara sara oṃ oṃ svāhā |

anena mantreṇa udakaṃ saptavārābhimantritam |
prātaścakṣusi saṃdatvā mohayet bhuvanatrayam ||

anyacca |

oṃ daṇḍāya mahādaṇḍāya svāhā 

iti mantreṇa vastrāntike granthiṃ baddhvā sarvaṃ mohayet |

rājāprajābandhubāndhavaśyālāmitraṃ parīkṣobhaya |

āni āni cāni cāni mohi mohi drīṃ drīṃ śrīṃ śrīṃ jagadvaśaṃ bhavatu 
svāhā |

anena mantreṇa sukhamārjanaṃ kuryāt tadā sarvaṃ vaśaṃ bhavet |

drū-īṃkāra saptadhā prītirasamārasasaṃyutam |
lalāṭe tilakaṃ kṛtvā yo jānaṃ vaśamānaret ||

yasya nāma gṛhītvā tu māyābījaṃ tridhā paṭhet |
muktakeśorddhvamukhe naiva mukhamārjanamācaret ||

satyaṃ satyaṃ mahādevi sa sarvaṃ vaśamānayet |

atha vīryajananam |

īśvarovāca |

atyantaṃ lavaṇaṃ kṣāraṃ śākāni kaṭutiktakam |
śuṣkaṃ paryusitañcaiva yatheṣṭabhojanaṃ tyajet ||

p. 34)

athātaḥ saṃpravakṣyāmi prayogaṃ vīryakāraṇam |
yasya bhakṣaṇamātreṇa vṛddhopi taruṇāyate ||

cūrṇaṃ vidāryāḥ saṃkṛtya svarasenaiva bhāṣitam |
śarkarā madhusarpibhiryuta liptvā payaḥ pibet ||

vṛddho yuvā bhaveddevi satyaṃ satyaṃ na cānyathā |
vidārīkandacūrṇantu ghṛtena payasā pibet ||

auḍumbararasenaiva vṛddhvāpi taruṇāyate |
bījaṃ gonavanītena samaṃyukte priyo bhavet ||

tūrṇo hantika vṛddhantu mahiṣāṇāṃ vasāṃ tathā |
kṛmiyātāṃ pātayettu saphalaṃ nātra saṃśayaḥ ||

viṣṇukrāntāmūlaśikhāṃ kare baddhvā tu yo ramet |
paṭṭasūtreṇa vai devi sthiravīryaṃ bhaved dhruvam ||

kṛṣṇāyāñca caturdaśyāṃ kaṭyāṃ baddhvā samāhitaḥ |
haret lāṅgalikāmūlaṃ siṃhe ca makarādikān ||

atha balabarddhanam |

ārdrakasya ca mūlañca kṛttikāyāṃ samuddharet |
mukhe kṣiptvā surañcāpi yadā ca vane gacchati ||

mahābalo mahāvīrya hasti hanti na saṃśayaḥ |

atha śrutidhāraṇam |

dhātrīmūlaṃ samānīya tilena saha cūrṇayet |
māsaikaṃ prātaḥ saṃbhuktvā naraḥ śrutidharo bhavet ||

atha astradhāraṇam |

mālamūlaṃ samānīya haste baddhvā gato vane |
tasya deheṣu śastrāṇi kadācinna patanti ca ||

p. 35)

atha gātraspandanakathanam |

athātaḥ saṃpravakṣyāmi gātraspandanajaṃ phalam |
yajjñātvā ca vijānīyāt śubhāśubhaphalaṃ naraḥ ||

śiraspandanamaiśvaryaṃ lalāṭaṃ rogakāraṇam |
lābhañca dakṣiṇe netre kalahaṃ vāmalocane ||

ubhayoḥ śokavārtāñca nāsormaraṇaṃmeva ca ||

oṣṭhe tu kalahañcaiva adhare miṣṭabhojanam |
dantamūlaspandanena avaśyaṃ māṃsabhojanam ||

spandena karṇayo vāpi phalasaṅgīta śravaṇam |
kaṇṭhe mārātmakaṃ yogaṃ kadācijjīvavadbhavet ||

arthalābhaṃ dakṣiṇe bhuje strīlābhaṃ vāmabhujake |
lakṣmīrvṛddhi dakṣiṇe pṛṣṭhe vāme ca paradārakam ||

ubhau ca śrīvṛddhiḥ syānnābhau ca maraṇaṃ bhavet |
dakṣak'tyāṃ vastralābhaṃ vāme mitra samāgamam |
utsavaṃ ubhayoḥ kaṭyoḥ liṅge ca yuvatī striyam ||

bhūmilābhaṃ dakṣiṇe gaṇḍe vāme buddhi ubhe dhanam |
videśagamanaṃ guhye rājabhayaṃ padadakṣiṇe |
vāmapāde ca gamanaṃ ubhayo rājasevanam ||

evaṃ vilikhayet spandaṃ śubhāśubhaphalaṃ labhet |

iti śrīharagaurīsaṃvāde gaurīkāñcalikātantraṃ samāptam |






     

